  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nCurrently, the spec about [auto-directionality form-associated elements](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/dom.html#auto-directionality-form-associated-elements) includes the Reset Button and Button states. However, Chrome and Firefox do not send the directionality for these two types.\n\nThis is tested here: https://wpt.fyi/results/html/semantics/forms/attributes-common-to-form-controls/dirname-only-if-applies.html?label=master&label=experimental&aligned\n\nAlternatively, [this step](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/form-control-infrastructure.html#constructing-form-data-set:auto-directionality-form-associated-elements) could be updated to check if the dirname attribute applies.",
